hpt_atdumbfiremissile_fixed_medium_refin:
Missile battery that launches dumbfire warheads loaded with a compound hazardous to Thargoid vessels. These can force Thargoid Interceptors to expose their hearts to focused weapons fire.

This enhanced model utilises a compound warhead variant that inflicts greatly increased damage.

$Outfitting_max_refined_modules;

hpt_atdumbfiremissile_turret_medium_refi:
Missile battery that launches dumbfire warheads loaded with a compound hazardous to Thargoid vessels. These can force Thargoid Interceptors to expose their hearts to focused weapons fire.

The turret-mounted version can be controlled by an active Gunner. 

$Outfitting_max_refined_modules;

hpt_atmulticannon_fixed_medium_refined_v:
Rapid-fire projectile weapon on a fixed mount. It fires small-calibre shells tipped with a compound hazardous to Thargoid vessels. These are especially useful against exposed Thargoid Interceptor hearts.

This enhanced version grants improved damage output to each projectile.

$Outfitting_max_refined_modules;

inbox_colonisation_architectperksintro:
Commander $#commanderName; 
The weekly dividend payment for your colonies has been completed. 

The total credited to you was $currency_prefix;$#totalCredits:number:separated=1;$currency_suffix;.  The contribution from each system was as follows:

inbox_fleetcarrier_debtcleared_body:
Commander,

I am happy to report that the balance of your carrier, $#CARRIERNAME;, has reached a positive value once again.

Remember that a weekly upkeep payment is withdrawn from the carrier’s balance to cover operational costs. Regular maintenance isn’t free and the crew have bills to pay too, you know?

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_jumpaborted_body:
Commander,

The scheduled hyperspace jump of your carrier, $#CARRIERNAME;, has been aborted $#REASON;. The carrier is currently located in the $#CARRIERSYSTEM; system.

You may schedule a new jump using the Carrier Management screen.

Regards,

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_jumpcomplete_body:
Commander,

Your carrier, $#CARRIERNAME;, has completed its scheduled hyperspace jump. The carrier is now located in the $#CARRIERSYSTEM; system.

Regards,

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_jumpdelayed_body:
Commander,

The scheduled hyperspace jump of your carrier, $#CARRIERNAME;, has been delayed $#REASON;.

A new cycle of system checks is underway and the hyperspace jump attempt will be repeated soon.

Regards,

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_jumpdelayedguest_body:
Greetings,

The scheduled hyperspace jump of the carrier $#CARRIERNAME; has been delayed $#REASON;.

As a result the carrier will remain in the $#CARRIERSYSTEM; system until a new destination is provided. On behalf of the crew, I apologise for any inconvenience caused by this delay.

Regards,

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_purchaseorderadjustme:
Commander,

While processing this week's finances, we discovered that our outstanding purchase orders exceed your carrier’s available funds. I've adjusted the active purchase orders to stay within budget.$#REMOVEDPO;

I encourage you to review all outstanding purchase orders and ensure that everything is set to your current requirements.

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

Commander,

Our purchase order for $#COMMODITYNAME; exceeds our available budget. I've resolved the issue for you, but I would advise you to review our purchase orders and ensure everything matches your specifications.$#REMOVEDPO;

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_fleetcarrier_weeklyupkeep_body:
Commander,

The weekly upkeep payment for your carrier $#CARRIERNAME; has been completed.

The total deducted from the carrier's balance was $#VALUE:currency:decimalPlaces=0;. This number can be broken down into the following:

- Core crew: $#COREVALUE:currency:decimalPlaces=0;
- Optional services: $#OPTIONALVALUE:currency:decimalPlaces=0;
- Hull maintenance: $#JUMPVALUE:currency:decimalPlaces=0;

Regards,

$#CAPTAINNAME;
Deck Officer of $#CARRIERNAME;

inbox_pp2_carepackage_automaticopened_bo:
Greetings, Agent $#commanderName;

$#total; of your powerplay care packages have been automatically opened, providing you with $#totalCredits; credits and the following materials: 
$#materials;

Regards, 
Office of $#powerName;

inbox_pp2_carepackage_expiry_body:
Greetings, Agent $#commanderName;
You have $#total; powerplay care packages which will soon reach their expiry threshold of $#days; days. After this time, these packages will be automatically opened and any materials in excess of your inventory capacity will be converted to credits. You are advised to visit a power contact to manually open these care packages at your earliest convenience.
Regards, Office of $#powername;

inbox_pp2_system_occupation_bonus_body:
You have received $#meritsToAward; due to your support in the occupation of the following systems previously owned by our rivals:

$#systemList;
On behalf of $#power;, thank you for your continued support toward our cause.

Regards, 
Office of $#powerName;

